data:{"type":"MESSAGES_SNAPSHOT","threadId":"vision-subagent","runId":"r1","messages":[{"id":"msg_004c8ebfe001IewUymPKR3quaU","role":"user","content":"请用 task 工具派一个子代理（subagent）去统计数据工作目录里 sales-2026-08.csv 的行数，你自己等待子代理结果后告诉我。"},{"id":"msg_004c8ec140015GhIRbMqFzRXZ9-r","role":"reasoning","content":"The user wants me to spawn a subagent to count the lines in the sales CSV file, wait for the result, and report back. Let me use the subagent tool with a suitable agent. The data working directory is workspace/threads/vision-subagent.\n\nLet me use the explorer or general subagent. I'll use general since it can execute multi-step tasks (counting lines). Actually the explore agent is read-only exploration. Counting lines is simple. Let me just use a general subagent.\n\nLet me spawn a foreground subagent."},{"id":"msg_004c8ec140015GhIRbMqFzRXZ9","role":"assistant","content":"","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_rvWMJ59EcvOx5rx9WjFk1927","type":"function","function":{"name":"subagent","arguments":"{\"agent\":\"general\",\"description\":\"统计销售CSV行数\",\"prompt\":\"请统计文件 workspace/threads/vision-subagent/sales-2026-08.csv 的数据行数（不含表头行）。先用 read 或 shell 确认文件存在并查看结构，然后用 wc -l 或等效方法计算总行数和数据行数（总行数减去表头行）。最后报告：文件路径、总行数、数据行数。\"}"}}]},{"id":"toolres-call_00_rvWMJ59EcvOx5rx9WjFk1927","role":"tool","toolCallId":"call_00_rvWMJ59EcvOx5rx9WjFk1927","content":"- 文件路径: `workspace/threads/vision-subagent/sales-2026-08.csv`\n- 总行数: 138（含表头）\n- 数据行数: 137（138 − 1 表头行，无空行）"},{"id":"msg_004c9039a001X726cd53abjXRs","role":"assistant","content":"子代理结果：`workspace/threads/vision-subagent/sales-2026-08.csv` 共 138 行（含表头），数据行数 **137**。"}]}

